description	"Aayla Secura

A Jedi Infiltration Master with high agility and resilience.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 5% faster RoF
-- Poisons On Hit
-- Melee Specials Do 85 Flat Knockback
- Lightsaber (Dual/Cyan Style)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- BP-Free Jumps
-- Cannot Be Disarmed
-- Poisons On Hit
-- 35% more special damage
-- Saber Throw (3) [45 Damage]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Speed - Speed Lunge (1) ^3[CS3]
- Mind Trick (1)
- Sense (1)

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (3)
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Healing Capped at 35
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (1)
- In-Air Force Regen
- Sense Stealth
- 15% Faster Skill Cooldowns

^3Abilities:
- Disguise (2) ^3[Style Swap In Melee]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]"
